            <ab type="layout">館方現代影像識別卡，記底本與攝影批次。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="2" facs="#f02" />
        <div n="2" type="scan" subtype="titled-cover">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="cover-title">
              <label>封面偏左墨筆直書</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black" xml:lang="ja">宮外妊孕經驗説并附録</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="accession-number">
              <label>正封印上登錄號</label>
