              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black">東洋醫學研究室</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">外封是整裝題名，與第4幅左面漢文篇的內題用字有別。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="3" facs="#f03" />
        <div n="3" type="scan" subtype="front-attachment-and-chinese-preface">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="donation-mark">
              <label>右面中偏右淡墨長方框</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black">昭和□□年三月廿□日
□□□
寄贈</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left" xml:lang="lzh">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f03-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">疾醫之道要在濟生而已矣豈有漢洋之別乎盖西洋</seg>
              <note type="original-mark" n="4" rend="black">、</note>
              <note type="original-mark" n="6" rend="black">㆓</note>
              <note type="original-mark" n="8" rend="black">㆒</note>
              <note type="original-mark" n="11" rend="black">、</note>
              <note type="original-mark" n="13" rend="black">㆓</note>
              <note type="original-mark" n="17" rend="black">㆒</note>
              <note type="original-mark" n="18" rend="black">、</note>
              <note type="source-note" n="8">
                <seg type="note-line" n="1">
                  <seg type="diplomatic-text">ニ</seg>
                </seg>
              </note>
              <note type="source-note" n="13">
                <seg type="note-line" n="1">
                  <seg type="diplomatic-text">ヤ</seg>
                </seg>
              </note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f03-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之長於究理精緻細察其説如竒怪然徴之於實際雖</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f03-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">漢人亦不得而拒也近有宮内一婦宮外妊孕醫以為</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f03-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">血塊又以為鼓脹自非桃源之卓識安能破開其腹因</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f03-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">而挾出毛骨以免非命之慘乎曩年府下土屋氏妻妊</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f03-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">孕三年腹出毛骨惠美大笑翁實往診視為文取中州</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f03-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">津有此證其孫玄仙亦往診今也玄仙子養健亦往診</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f03-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之嗚呼惠美氏以主張仲景聞於天下而其所為如此</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f03-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">盖累世子孫之篤於濟生可謂善繼祖業已若夫臆斷</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f03-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">強辯不徴實際以負疾醫之職者非啻不為仲景之忠</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f03-l-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">臣而亦惠美氏之罪人也桃源著經驗説予作附録又</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal">
              <label>序面靠近中縫上方朱印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">〔印文待釋〕</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="deletion">
              <label>序面由右第四欄欄末疊改</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black">腹後的因形字可見交叉劃覆。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="reading-marks-coverage" facs="#f03-retention-marks">
              <label>左面序文原筆訓點區</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black">序文字旁滿有訓點與細小片假名。本次選錄可明確定位者，同連原圖供續校。</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">左首為漢文序，欄側密集寫有細小送り仮名、短合符和返點。第4幅右面是序末。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:None">
              <quote>寄贈記</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">昭和十九年三月廿一日</seg>
              <note type="editorial">年月日淡墨，完整日期及寄贈者名字留待精讀。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:4">
              <quote>其腹因</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">因</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">削除字</seg>
              <note type="editorial">欄末方形墨字疊寫交叉，暫按可見原位列，與刪除痕跡分層。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:6">
