              <seg type="candidate">中州</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">中洲</seg>
              <note type="editorial">末字疑州；下一欄首「津」。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="4" facs="#f04" />
        <div n="4" type="scan" subtype="preface-date-and-case-title">
          <div type="page-face" n="right" xml:lang="lzh">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f04-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">題數言為之序云安政丁巳十月望三宅春齡撰</seg>
              <note type="original-mark" n="1" rend="black">㆓</note>
              <note type="original-mark" n="3" rend="black">㆒</note>
              <note type="original-mark" n="4" rend="black">㆓</note>
              <note type="original-mark" n="6" rend="black">㆒</note>
              <note type="source-note" n="3">
                <seg type="note-line" n="1">
                  <seg type="diplomatic-text">ヲ</seg>
                </seg>
              </note>
              <note type="source-note" n="6">
                <seg type="note-line" n="1">
                  <seg type="diplomatic-text">ト</seg>
                </seg>
              </note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal">
              <label>右半葉大朱方印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">千葉大學圖書館</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="accession-number">
              <label>朱章下</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="blue">86694</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal">
              <label>序末旁上方小朱印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">〔印文待釋〕</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal">
              <label>序末旁下方朱框印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">〔印文待釋〕</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="reading-marks-coverage" facs="#f04-preface-end">
              <label>右面序末上段訓點區</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black">可定位的返點及部分片假名分錄，與序文正文分開。</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left" xml:lang="lzh">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f04-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">子宮外孕胎經驗</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f04-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">佐伯郡宮内村黨正治右衛門妻年齒四十三矣昨春日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f04-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">罹嬰非常之疾今秋來寓于其弟廣陵東魚屋町若松屋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f04-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">清兵衛宅請治一醫某服藥十餘日無効八月十四日請</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f04-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">余々診之口舌生□口瘡時々呃噦臭氣如敗卵脉沈而</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f04-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">微身體痩羸骨角刺手全腹彭脹前部突出坐則殆冒膝</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f04-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">頭左右脇下反如削其状異于尋常腹滿症且臍上二寸</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f04-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">許皮肉稍隆起中央柔軟周圍硬結為輪其色如常按之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f04-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">微痛如有膿瘍焉余乃審問其平素與其疾患之次序親</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f04-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">族曰天資健康曾産四男三女昨年正月中旬經血如常</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f04-l-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">其後爾來二月三月無事四月初旬發心下苦煩惡心等</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="12" xml:id="f04-l-c12">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之症自以為妊娠惡阻而不藥同月二十六日俄然腹肚</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal">
              <label>病例開篇上方墨印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black">東洋醫學研究室</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右是三宅春齡序末及署年，左有新的獨立內題和病例，正文筆勢清簡，兩種文字層分開。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:2">
              <quote>昨春日</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">日</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">曰</seg>
              <note type="editorial">左末單字形近，後接第3欄罹嬰。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:3">
              <quote>罹嬰</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">罹</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">罹形異體</seg>
              <note type="editorial">首字有糸狀左筆，字形描畫可再核。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:5">
              <quote>口舌生□口瘡</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">黴</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">苔</seg>
              <note type="editorial">生與口間字墨筆較繁，保留位置。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:12">
              <quote>俄然腹肚</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">肚</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">肛</seg>
              <note type="editorial">欄末字未完全清晰，待回圖。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="5" facs="#f05" />
        <div n="5" type="scan" subtype="chinese-case-body">
          <div type="page-face" n="right" xml:lang="lzh">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f05-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">拘痛苦楚難堪呼吸短速殆欲衝心急請治村醫某百藥</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f05-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">無効痛苦或緩或急荏苒經日腹漸彭脹六月中旬衆醫</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f05-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">相議投峻下劑一夜暴瀉六七行苦楚減大半然腹脹如</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f05-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">故自覺小腹微動衆醫一決称妊漸々痛苦相減八月九</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f05-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">月稍務家事則辭醫某十月初旬胎子劇動衝逆胸脇痛</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f05-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">苦難堪飲食乍退嘔吐屢發又請治前醫十一月諸症或</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f05-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">緩或急十二月中旬又大劇發同二十日胎動頓止苦楚</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f05-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">稍緩呃逆亦止飲食漸進然全腹倍彭脹矣是以前醫謂</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f05-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">是非妊鼓脹病也遂雖療之諸症依然閏年二月中旬小</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f05-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">腹拘痛産門脱出血塊二枚其大如毬尚漏稀血數日而</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f05-r-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">収又五月下旬脱出塊血稀血如前閏五月中旬發心下</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="12" xml:id="f05-r-c12">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">急痛呃逆苦悶等之症四五日而自緩解然隔年月或一</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left" xml:lang="lzh">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f05-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">月而發作遂無窮腹脹倍甚飲食漸減衰弱日加百計</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f05-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">無効於是今月五日相携詣于此地請治一醫某々亦</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f05-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">称鼓脹療之溏瀉如傾同十二日心下急痛煩悶難堪彭</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f05-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">吐膽汁食慾忽退衰弱至于今日云云及茲余更開眼目</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f05-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">再診其腹状盡心力而熟察始終之景况矣沈黙數刻豁然</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f05-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">似貫通為斷謂是非鼓脹西説所謂子宮外孕胎也前年</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f05-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">臘月胎子既死腐穢侵蝕腹膜臍上隆起之部應為膿管</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f05-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">是以乃詳告親族親族或疑之更使後藤松軒診之松軒</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f05-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">慨然曰妙哉余克知此症默識多年未嘗看斯人而今日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f05-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">親觀之宿考與事實如今符節豈足狐疑乎親族始信余</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f05-l-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">言相議請治余雖固辭而曰從前年臘月至今日諸醫以</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="12" xml:id="f05-l-c12">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">鼓脹療之衰弱愈極且腐敗弥蔓于母體之血中命期在</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">兩面分別12欄。正文多有淡墨透背，與本面的確定文字區分。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:5">
              <quote>胸脇痛</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">脇</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">脯</seg>
              <note type="editorial">待查月字右旁。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:11">
              <quote>収</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">収</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">收</seg>
              <note type="editorial">書手的收字左旁筆形短，按原墨暫作収。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:3">
              <quote>溏瀉</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">溏</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">濘</seg>
              <note type="editorial">潮墨略深，保候讀。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:9">
              <quote>慨然曰妙哉</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">妙</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">奶形</seg>
              <note type="editorial">楷行混合，第四字候妙。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="6" facs="#f06" />
        <div n="6" type="scan" subtype="chinese-case-conclusion">
          <div type="page-face" n="right" xml:lang="lzh">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">近雖施其治安奏其功乎親族曰久雖療之未得其方一</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">得其方療之則明日死可也冀君加仁慈為懇請不止余</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">不忍辭之則十八日夜投保固強壮滋補之劑貼造膿膏</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f06-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">于臍上隆起之部翌日診之臍上大隆起且焮赤呃逆自</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f06-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">止終得啜稀粥更與松軒相議急作鷄肉羮汁與之又自</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f06-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">請喫上好酒幸而則令吞之二十日飲食稍増腫處倍焮</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f06-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">痛二十一日夜腫處自破潰漏敗膿五六合臭氣穿鼻不</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f06-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">可近膿中雜出胎髪即以硬膏覆瘡口施縛帯終夜膿汁</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f06-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">流滴蓐衣如投水中翌二十二日診之瘡口濶大漏膿汁</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f06-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">胎髪如前腹部柔軟得著診胎兒敗膿愈流出瘡口益濶</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f06-r-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">大而挾指頭于瘡口探得兒頭於是二十四日使外科西</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="12" xml:id="f06-r-c12">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">道夀診之道夀利刀剥脱瘡口之腐肉二十五日道夀同</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left" xml:lang="lzh">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">男道一從瘡口出胎兒頭盖骨二片其翌二十六日大出</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">一片逐次雖欲出全骨疲勞殊甚不能果外術二十七日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">終上鬼簿矣其胎髪頭盖骨余家藏焉</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f06-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">安政丁巳暮秋高橋一貫桃源誌之</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">全篇止於左面高橋一貫桃源1857年署記，署記左側透背的字不屬本面；第7幅右另有和文新題。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:1">
              <quote>命期在近</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">近</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">迄</seg>
              <note type="editorial">形右上有斜筆，尋義不作定讀依據。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:8">
              <quote>縛帯</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">帯</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">帶</seg>
              <note type="editorial">目前先保留可見日式形。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:12">
              <quote>道夀</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">夀</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">壽</seg>
              <note type="editorial">原字中間多層交筆，仍依同欄各處同形。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="7" facs="#f07" />
        <div n="7" type="scan" subtype="out-of-scope-attached-works">
          <ab type="status">右面另有三宅春齡的和文附錄，現幅說明題名及篇界。</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
